window.products.push({"id":92132,"name":"119367 Reusable Coffee Filters Compatible with Keurig K Cup 2.0 Series Replacement Parts K200 K250 K300 K350 K400 K450 K460 K475 K460 K500 K550 K560 K","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71rs9dFVn+L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"119367 Reusable Coffee Filte exact fits Keurig K Cup My 2.0 brewers Product Description: This reusable coffee filter K-Cup following the green lifestyle and efficient design concept of keurig coffee machine, we focus on product design, shape, material, only to bring the mellow coffee, delicious enjoyment to more coffee lovers. Compatible With: Keuring Brewers: k-mini Brewer, K-Mini Plus, K-Compact, K-Classic, k-Select, K-Elite,K-Latte,K-Cafe Keuring Plus Series Brewers:k200/250,k425/475,k525/575 Package Includes: 2 x 119367 Reusable Coffee Filte 1 x Cleaning Brush Steps: 1. Remove the cap by turning it counter-clockwise, until the UNLOCK icon reaches the middle of the handle. 2. Wash the cap and main chamber with warm soapy water prior to first use. Rinse and dry thoroughly. 3. Fill the main chamber with your desired amount of ground coffee. 4. Replace the cap by aligning the UNLOCK icon with the handle and turn the cap clockwise. The cap is properly closed when you feel the cap click into place and the LOCK icon aligns with the handle. 5. Open the brewer handle and insert the reusable filter into the cup holder. 6. Select your brew size and press the brew button. Note: For K-Mini, the handle on the side comes off and the filter fits in; For K-Elite, remove the outer lower sleeve with the large rib, pry the rib out to be unlatched; For K-Duo, similarly a piece of the machine should be removed first as well. After-Sales Service: If you have any question about our product, please feel free to contact us through amazon email, we will solve your problem within 24 hours.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71rs9dFVn+L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"KABRHEL JAN VTR","source_asin":"B08NZQ1K7D","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-92132","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08NZQ1K7D","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Appliances.jsonl","source_asin":"B08NZQ1K7D","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
