window.products.push({"id":92174,"name":"Stove Cover, Stove Top Cover Protector for Samsung Gas Ranges, Reusable Non-Stick Top Burner Cover Protectors, Thick Washable Cover For Gas Burners","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61amuniNqIL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","description":"EASY TO INSTALL AND REMOVE - The stove top cover is designed for Samsung Ranges, all you need to do is put it on your stove top. PLEASE MAKE SURE THE SIZE OF THE PROTECTOR MATCHES YOUR STOVE BEFORE PURCHASING. For detailed size information, please find our product pictures. 、 Easy to CLEAN - The non-stick coating stove mat keeps your stove from overflow, stain,oil during cooking, while very easy to clean. This stove top burner cover can be washed by hand or dishwasher. HEAT RESISTANCE -The gas stove covers made of high-quality PTFE, and can resist the temperature without burning and melting. However, Please avoid using directly on the flame. UPGRADED - 0.4mm thickening design and reinforcement treatment on the edge make the stove protector more durable. FUNCTION - The stove top cover keep your stove clean and tidy all the time. All oil stains, spills or grease can be caught on the mat and cleaned easily.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61amuniNqIL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"YumSur","source_asin":"B09HC935VS","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-92174","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09HC935VS","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Appliances.jsonl","source_asin":"B09HC935VS","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":92175,"name":"Washing Machine Hoses, 2 PACK 6ft Washer Hose Burst Proof- Stainless Steel Braided Laundry Hose Hot and Cold Water Supply Hoses for Washing Machines (","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81rOzHIdf+L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"This premium set of Stainless Steel Washing Machine Hoses are designed to handle the stresses of the laundry room - extreme hot and cold temperatures, countless hours of use in cramped spaces and the agitation and friction from a running washing machine.  6 Feet of supply hose means you can move the washer around for retrieving lost clothes or normal maintenance - without having to disconnect the washing machine inlet hose every time. You wont have to strain your self reaching into awkward positions to connect and disconnect a washer hose that is too short. Pick up our washing machine connectors and compare them to any other off the shelf washer hoses. You will feel the high quality materials and workmanship. The weight alone shows these are heavy duty. Don't risk inferior rubber or other low quality hoses leaking water and damaging your home and property. INSTALLATION INSTRUCTIONS: Make sure supply taps are turned OFF.  1. Remove old hoses from supply taps. 2. Hand-tighten your new supply hoses onto the supply taps. 3. Then give another 1/2 turn each with a pair of pliers (we recommend using tongue-and-groove pliers, as shown in the photo above. 4. Locate supply inlets on your washing machine. They should be labeleled \"HOT\" and \"COLD\", but in case they are not then you can assume that the HOT is on the left (like the picture above) and the COLD is on the right. 5. Hand-tighten the other end of your new supply hoses onto the corresponding inlets on your washer (hot to hot, cold to cold). 6. Then give another 1/2 turn each with a pair of pliers.  You may now turn ON your supply taps. NOTE: Before testing your washing machine, please ensure that your discharge (drain) hose is installed properly as well.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81rOzHIdf+L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"AIFUSI","source_asin":"B07SDG2755","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-92175","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07SDG2755","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Appliances.jsonl","source_asin":"B07SDG2755","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
