window.products.push({"id":92635,"name":"Filterlogic UKF8001 Replacement for EveryDrop Filter 4, Whirlpool EDR4RXD1, Maytag 4396395, UKF8001AXX-200, UKF8001AXX-750, 46-9006, Puriclean II, FMM","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":27.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71VDNpnDXsL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Filterlogic FL-RF07 Refrigerator Water Filter Relacement for Whirlpool Filter 4 The Filterlogic refrigerator water filter is certified by NSF 42 and 372 standards. The innovative design and advanced materials reduce chlorine, taste and odor from your water source, leaving you with healthier water and a cleaner, fresher taste. Premium filter material: Here at Filterlogic, we adopt 100% natural coconut shell carbon block containing twice the surface area and more micropores than an inferior carbon block. Maximum filtration: The Filterlogic refrigerator filter reduce a wide range of harmful substances from your water source including chlorine and all other major impurities, as certified by an independent, third-party laboratory. Safe materials: We select exclusively BPA-free and food-grade filter materials that are NSF 372 certified lead-free. Crisp and fresh water: With our 100% natural coconut shell carbon block, more impurities can be absorbed than low-priced and mixed carbon block. Filterlogic refrigerator filter significantly improves the taste of drinking water to provide pure-tasting water. Perfect fit: Filterlogic is constructed with precise measurement technology, used to perfectly reproduce the original scale parameters of the original brand filter with advanced industrial automation equipment. We can promise that there is no water leakage. The filter can be easily installed in minutes without tools. Monthly install stickers: The set of our month install stickers included with your purchase assists you in keeping track of the filter lifespan without writing it on your calendar. Each Filterlogic filter functions optimally for 6 months or 300 gallons, which will vary based on water condition. Change it on time to ensure fresh-tasting water. Replacement models: Maytag UKF8001, EveryDrop Filter 4, EDR4RXD1, EDR4RXD2, Whirlpool 4396395, UKF8001AXX-750, UKF8001AXX-200, Amana UKF8001P, UKF8001AXX, UKF9001, Sears or Kenmore 9006, 46-9006, 9992, 9005, 9084, 469084, Bosch BORPLFTR20, Viking RWFFR, 67003523-750, 67006475, WF295, Puriclean II, FMM-2. Replacement models: WF-UKF8001, Wrx735sdhz, Wrf555sdfz, Wrx735sdbm, Mfi2568aes, Wrx735sdhz00, Wrx735sdhz02, Wrx735sdhz01, Wrf555sdfz09, Krfc300ess01, Wrx735sdbm, Wrx735sdhz03, Wrx735sdbm04, Krfc302ess00, Wrf555sdfz05, Wrf555sdfz12, W11256135, Wrf535swhz, Wrf555sdfz, Krfc300ess. High standards, high integrity: We oversee each step of the manufacturing process. Quality remains our responsibility when the filter leaves the factory. Our 24/7 customer service team can provide solutions to your water purification needs at any time.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71VDNpnDXsL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"FilterLogic","source_asin":"B087PJ2392","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-92635","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B087PJ2392","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Appliances.jsonl","source_asin":"B087PJ2392","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":92636,"name":"EATON SGF15LA Wiring Duplex Self-Test Gfci Receptacle, 4.2 in L X 1.68 in W X 1.27 in D, Automatic, Light Almond","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":23.04,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71OOcux2nrL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Automatic testing GFCI receptacle. If no GFCI protection is present, the receptacle will render itself inoperable and a red indicator light will glow. Eaton GFCI self-test Duplex receptacle provides protection from dangerous electrical shocks caused by ground faults. Our GFCI devices automatically self-test periodically to ensure GFCI protection and continuous safety. In addition to being tested to the highest standards to help ensure safety, Eaton GFCIs will deny power and prevent re-setting if the device is no longer able to provide safe, protected power. The built-in indicator lights provide quick notification of a tripped or “end of life” condition.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71OOcux2nrL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Eaton","source_asin":"B015BHY1ZG","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-92636","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B015BHY1ZG","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Appliances.jsonl","source_asin":"B015BHY1ZG","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
