window.products.push({"id":92699,"name":"285785 Washer Clutch Kit Assembly Whirlpool Kenmore AP3094537 Part Washing Machine PS334641 Maytag Replacement Wtw5200vq2 Atw4475xq0 Lsb6200pq2 Lsq753","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61ETIl3VjGS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"💡 Washer Clutch 285785 - An equivalent for parts 2670, 285331, 285380, 285422, 285540, 285785VP, 3350015, 3946847, 3951311, 3951312, 62699, 63174, 63765, 64176, AH334641, J27-662, LP326. Clutch Assembly 285785 is compatible with Whirlpool, Admiral, Amana, Crosley, Estate, Inglis, Kenmore, KitchenAid, Magic Chef, Maytag, Roper. Whirlpool Clutch Assembly 285785 is an essential component used in many top-loading washer's to help the machine shift gears and spin the clothes during the spin cycles. 🔧 DIY eTips Included - Not sure how to replace the Whirlpool Clutch Kit 285785? Helpful information can be found on the page below. Scroll down to get more repair tips. Acquire valuable skills during the DIY repair project. Washer Clutch Assembly 285785 will help if your appliance pumps but does not spin, spins slowly, does not agitate, or is noisy. Replace it, if you notice a burning smell. The Washing Machine Clutch 285785 fits hundred of models and can be easily installed in a few minutes. 💡 Whirlpool Washing Machine Clutch 285785 is responsible for spinning the basket during the spin cycle. Kenmore Washing Machine Clutch 285785 is made of plastic and metal and comes in beige/silver. Over time, the clutch lining can wear out and prevent the assembly from releasing the brake properly, so it's very important to replace it in time. The Whirlpool Part 285785 meets or exceeds all manufacturer specifications. We provide a lifetime warranty and guarantee 100% money back. 💡 The main function of the Whirlpool Clutch 285785 is to help the washing machine shift gears and spin the clothes during the wash and spin cycles. When the washing machine's motor rotates in one direction, the clutch engages, allowing the transmission to spin and agitate the clothes. When the motor rotates in the opposite direction, the clutch disengages, allowing the transmission to spin freely. 💡 What is the lifespan of a 285785 Clutch Kit? The lifespan of a Whirlpool Washer Clutch 285785 can vary depending on a variety of factors such as usage frequency, load size, and overall maintenance of the washing machine. However, in general, a Whirlpool 285785 Clutch can last several years before it needs to be replaced. It is recommended to check the clutch periodically for signs of wear and tear, such as excessive noise or difficulty in shifting gears, and to replace it if necessary.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61ETIl3VjGS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"PartsBroz","source_asin":"B07YD7W1DG","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-92699","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07YD7W1DG","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Appliances.jsonl","source_asin":"B07YD7W1DG","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
