window.products.push({"id":92785,"name":"NewAir NBF125BK00 Beer Froster Refrigerator and Cooler with Glass Door, 125 Can Capacity Freestanding Beer Fridge in Black - Cool to 23 F With Beer an","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":799.98,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81TE2GczjsL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Whether it’s running last minute errands or watching your favorite baseball team strike out on the last inning, meet the world’s first beer chiller that protects against the dreaded warm beer party foul. The NewAir beer froster works hard to ensure moments like these are met with your favorite frosty beverage. Benefits: 23 Degrees: One of the coldest beverage centers on the market. At this frosty temperature, your mass market American beer will taste its best. Store more than just light beer at 23 degrees: beer mugs, whisky glasses, or mini kegs can all be kept in your Froster to be served up icy cold. It is not recommended to store all types of beverages at 23F. When storing beverages for long periods of time, follow the Froster temperature guide to be sure your drinks are safely stored and ready to enjoy. Turbo Mode: Never drink a lukewarm beverage again! Turbo mode is a last-minute errand runner’s dream. As soon as you put your beverages in the Froster, turn on Turbo mode. In only an hour you will get beer that is frosty-cold and ready to drink. Once your lukewarm beer turns ice cold, the mode turns off and the Froster adjusts to the set temperature. Party Mode: Built to withstand thirsty partygoers. Do people keep opening your fridge door and letting all the cool air out? Party mode keeps the Froster compressor on for 6-hours straight. No matter how many times that door swings open, Party mode will keep your beer frosty-cold and tasting it’s best. Finally, a fridge that can keep up. Once those six hours are up, the Froster adjusts to the temperature set on the digital thermostat. Heated Glass: Insulated door with a frost-free look. A heated glass door stays frost-free under the coldest conditions. You’ll always be able to keep your eye on what’s inside. Plus, the heated glass adds to the sleek design of this black beverage cooler.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81TE2GczjsL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"NewAir","source_asin":"B0BLB314TG","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-92785","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BLB314TG","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Appliances.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BLB314TG","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
